[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3361.27, "timestamp": "00:56:01", "text": "我会喝的。没问题。呃，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3363.91, "timestamp": "00:56:03", "text": "对，就是那种夹心饼干，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3365.27, "timestamp": "00:56:05", "text": "中间是水果状的东西。是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3368.15, "timestamp": "00:56:08", "text": "拍。是的，塔德。欢快。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3369.27, "timestamp": "00:56:09", "text": "很不错。我离开中间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3370.95, "timestamp": "00:56:10", "text": "最后一部分的一部分。不，我只是吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3373.589, "timestamp": "00:56:13", "text": "它。我只咬了一半，另一半。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3375.51, "timestamp": "00:56:15", "text": "一半什么的。如果它卡在我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3379.349, "timestamp": "00:56:19", "text": "牙齿有点问题，不过这不是我的问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3381.47, "timestamp": "00:56:21", "text": "对，我刚才说到哪儿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3384.789, "timestamp": "00:56:24", "text": "对不起。我应该再三考虑的。红色的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3386.95, "timestamp": "00:56:26", "text": "啵。哦。哦，等等。不，不，不。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3390.069, "timestamp": "00:56:30", "text": "蓝莓。哦，茶。是啊，但是就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3392.309, "timestamp": "00:56:32", "text": "是的。我通常只喝茶，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3394.87, "timestamp": "00:56:34", "text": "想保持健康，如果我能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3397.99, "timestamp": "00:56:37", "text": "我会喝掉它，好好享受一番，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3400.15, "timestamp": "00:56:40", "text": "我不是那种会主动去找的人。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3402.15, "timestamp": "00:56:42", "text": "是啊，因为就像我每次……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3404.549, "timestamp": "00:56:44", "text": "有人递给我茶的时候，我感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3408.63, "timestamp": "00:56:48", "text": "有点像忧郁，或者实际上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3410.63, "timestamp": "00:56:50", "text": "开始感觉有点恶心，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3412.309, "timestamp": "00:56:52", "text": "病态吧？你知道那些症状"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3413.51, "timestamp": "00:56:53", "text": "你知道自己会在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3417.03, "timestamp": "00:56:57", "text": "像发烧生病了一样？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3419.27, "timestamp": "00:56:59", "text": "是的。就像人们喜欢提供的那样"}]